---
title: "A technical foundation. A broader perspective."
intro: "My current professional work focuses on the technical assessment and monitoring of EU-funded projects with IT components. I review technical documentation, reported progress and project deliverables, drawing on my knowledge of European funding procedures and reporting systems, including MySMIS and the PNRR platform."
---

My professional background combines software engineering, systems analysis, project management and executive leadership, with experience in Romania, Canada and the United States. Working across these different roles has given me an understanding of both technical implementation and organizational decision-making.

A significant part of my career has been connected to the energy sector, particularly IT management, enterprise systems integration, cybersecurity and technology projects. My Project Management Professional (PMP®) certification complements this experience with a structured project management perspective.

I also explore practical applications of artificial intelligence and automation. I develop Python scripts and use cloud-based and local AI tools to support document analysis, information processing and repetitive workflows, with particular attention to confidentiality and data protection.

My professional interests lie at the intersection of technology, business and project delivery — where technical understanding, effective communication and sound judgment can make a practical difference.

This website is where I share professional experiences, ideas, projects and things I'm continuing to learn and build.
